{"id":"honne_tete_","lemma":"honnêteté","pos":"noun","rank":3519,"glosses":["honesty"],"ipa":"/ɔ.nɛt.te/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/bf/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-honn%C3%AAtet%C3%A9.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-honn%C3%AAtet%C3%A9.wav.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"honnêtetés"},"examples":[{"text":"Je suis convaincu de son honnêteté.","en":"I am convinced of his honesty.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"convinced, sure"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his, her, its"},null]},{"text":"J'apprécie votre honnêteté.","en":"I appreciate your honesty.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to appreciate","l":"apprécier"},{"g":"your, belonging to you"},null]},{"text":"Je vous remercie de votre honnêteté.","en":"I thank you for your honesty.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to thank","l":"remercier"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"your, belonging to you"},null]},{"text":"L'honnêteté, c'est très important.","en":"Honesty is very important.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"important"}]},{"text":"Votre honnêteté est rafraîchissante.","en":"Your honesty is refreshing.","words":[{"g":"your, belonging to you"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"refreshing","l":"rafraîchissant"}]}]}